{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"4e24a3b0-6e6b-49bd-9748-21d868294f59":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/star-rating\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"da8ef1d6-d5ee-4fd6-a726-7c6359134946":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Required gang tier not reached","set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":""}},"d5d2323d-4447-414d-8f12-2e11f9036b3e":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","settings":{"data_key":"credit-promotion-badge","theme":"light","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>Introducing our Very Cherry Halloween Edition! Take your Halloween celebrations to the next level with a spooky version of our fan favourite. Perfect for parties, gifting and to elevate your Halloween cocktails.<\/p><p>Very Cherry Halloween is a <strong>LIMITED<\/strong> edition, and only available whilst stocks last.<\/p>","page":""}},"58400cf8-e650-467e-8b8e-590606422b43":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Moonshine Must-Haves","icon":"check_mark","content":"<p>1. Your jar of <a href=\"\/collections\/moonshine\" title=\"Moonshine\">Moonshine<\/a>.<\/p><p>2. Our reusable <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\">Pouring Lid<\/a> to not waste a drop.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<h3>Very Cherry Coke<\/h3><ul><li>60ml <em>Very Cherry<\/em><\/li><li>Cola<\/li><li>Fresh Lime Juice<\/li><li>Ice cubes<\/li><\/ul><p>Fill a tall glass with ice cubes, pour in <em>Very Cherry<\/em> and then top up with cola. Finally, add a squeeze of lime juice and stir. Serve and enjoy!<\/p><p>If you like it a little stronger, you can add 20ml of <a href=\"\/products\/high-proof\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"High Proof\"><em>High Proof.<\/em><\/a><\/p><p>You can find more recipes in our <a href=\"\/blogs\/cocktails\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Cocktails\">Cocktails Blog<\/a>.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"ec1b1391-2ea5-46b3-9ace-b333f4f99398":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products are suitable for vegans and those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","caption","4e24a3b0-